# Lich sets its controller's life to zero as it enters, and prevents a loss at zero (CR 614.1c, 704.5a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Lich
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lich.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Result = InProgress
Bot1.Life = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Lich; Mox Jet
